{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499430/extras/ba0ade1884e3aaaebc4f9cb85add4eca.avif?t=1773338165\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499430/extras_big/ba0ade1884e3aaaebc4f9cb85add4eca.avif?t=1773338165 width=800 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use two decks of cards to serve food to your customers during the day! Then fight them off when they turn to monsters at night in this fun and unique deckbuilding roguelike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499430/extras/cd5eef924c443abb5ef3624a7e4fe752.avif?t=1773338165\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499430/extras_big/cd5eef924c443abb5ef3624a7e4fe752.avif?t=1773338165 width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your 2 decks and make decisions that impact both decks simultaneously, it is important to consider the impact any choice you might make on both your day and night!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499430/extras/df9a883b72d89d7e81e9da1f2f40839a.avif?t=1773338165\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499430/extras_big/df9a883b72d89d7e81e9da1f2f40839a.avif?t=1773338165 width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the day you must act as head chef of a team of kitty cooks! By serving the customers you can earn tips and stop them becoming angry when they transform into monsters while darkness falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499430/extras/6e5de7c57f9eb6e48e59bd3f6cbeac80.avif?t=1773338165\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499430/extras_big/6e5de7c57f9eb6e48e59bd3f6cbeac80.avif?t=1773338165 width=800 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night, the same customers you worked so hard to serve come back, but they are no longer human! Under the light of the moon, they have turned into various mythological creatures from all over the world. They have been sent to take over your restaurant!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499430/extras/3a5673aef04424d9e7f6956ceb2a981a.avif?t=1773338165\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499430/extras_big/3a5673aef04424d9e7f6956ceb2a981a.avif?t=1773338165 width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the week and defeat powerful bosses assisted by your cat chefs! These bosses are a real challenge and will allow your restaurant to grow! By defeating the final boss your restaurant will be granted an esteemed Mitchel Star!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499430/extras/2aeeb2de0dba8571ec7078dc55264e0d.avif?t=1773338165\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499430/extras_big/2aeeb2de0dba8571ec7078dc55264e0d.avif?t=1773338165 width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning runs will grant you exciting powerups that you can use in your next adventure! These have game changing abilities that affect everything from the food you cook to the enemies' lifeforce.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3499430?t=1773338165","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499430/de57c1ad9fe571952d52f14cb1f6435b18133741/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773338165","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499430/689f2ec059a22f33d4a3151e75a791b07332f9da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773338165","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499430/689f2ec059a22f33d4a3151e75a791b07332f9da/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773338165","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499430/extras/ba0ade1884e3aaaebc4f9cb85add4eca.avif?t=1773338165\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499430/extras_big/ba0ade1884e3aaaebc4f9cb85add4eca.avif?t=1773338165 width=800 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use two decks of cards to serve food to your customers during the day! Then fight them off when they turn to monsters at night in this fun and unique deckbuilding roguelike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499430/extras/cd5eef924c443abb5ef3624a7e4fe752.avif?t=1773338165\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499430/extras_big/cd5eef924c443abb5ef3624a7e4fe752.avif?t=1773338165 width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your 2 decks and make decisions that impact both decks simultaneously, it is important to consider the impact any choice you might make on both your day and night!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499430/extras/df9a883b72d89d7e81e9da1f2f40839a.avif?t=1773338165\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499430/extras_big/df9a883b72d89d7e81e9da1f2f40839a.avif?t=1773338165 width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the day you must act as head chef of a team of kitty cooks! By serving the customers you can earn tips and stop them becoming angry when they transform into monsters while darkness falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499430/extras/6e5de7c57f9eb6e48e59bd3f6cbeac80.avif?t=1773338165\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499430/extras_big/6e5de7c57f9eb6e48e59bd3f6cbeac80.avif?t=1773338165 width=800 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night, the same customers you worked so hard to serve come back, but they are no longer human! Under the light of the moon, they have turned into various mythological creatures from all over the world. They have been sent to take over your restaurant!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499430/extras/3a5673aef04424d9e7f6956ceb2a981a.avif?t=1773338165\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499430/extras_big/3a5673aef04424d9e7f6956ceb2a981a.avif?t=1773338165 width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the week and defeat powerful bosses assisted by your cat chefs! These bosses are a real challenge and will allow your restaurant to grow! By defeating the final boss your restaurant will be granted an esteemed Mitchel Star!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499430/extras/2aeeb2de0dba8571ec7078dc55264e0d.avif?t=1773338165\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499430/extras_big/2aeeb2de0dba8571ec7078dc55264e0d.avif?t=1773338165 width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning runs will grant you exciting powerups that you can use in your next adventure! These have game changing abilities that affect everything from the food you cook to the enemies' lifeforce.</p>","developers":["Shy Penguin Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499430/6298a510ee1826efc3d1700a0e43dff64c61455e/header.jpg?t=1773338165","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Copyright - Shy Penguin Studios, 2025","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3499430/1117111341/d4072425da717cabdf5e51c2f687e6424a8105f5/1766132947/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766133319","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3499430/1117111341/d4072425da717cabdf5e51c2f687e6424a8105f5/1766132947/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766133319","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3499430/1117111341/d4072425da717cabdf5e51c2f687e6424a8105f5/1766132947/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1766133319","id":257229110,"name":"A Recipe for Survival Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257229110/69f5b00bd4f5722a3e1837e65b47ca386242ce97/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1766133319"}],"name":"A Recipe for Survival - Cat Cooking Roguelike Deckb